    },
    {
      "displayText": "钢甲鸟宝可梦盔甲鸟……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94A275329E1F5B9D53EF68A676D475329E1F20262026001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它掉落的羽毛又薄又锐利，\n以前被当成刀，而现在则被当成菜刀使用。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B836389843D76847FBD6BDB53C8858453C895105229FF0C000A4EE5524D88AB5F5362105200FF0C800C73B05728521988AB5F53621083DC52004F7F75283002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想送礼物给超一流的主厨，\n因此想要盔甲鸟的羽毛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F39001793C72697ED98D854E006D4176844E3B53A8FF0C000A56E06B6460F3898176D475329E1F76847FBD6BDB3002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以我希望拜托你这位ZA登峰战的\n训练家帮我寻找盔甲鸟的羽毛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE562115E0C671B62DC62584F608FD94F4D005A0041767B5CF062187684000A8BAD7EC35BB65E2E62115BFB627E76D475329E1F76847FBD6BDB3002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但在能找到盔甲鸟的\n17号野生特区里，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n都是一些凶暴的宝可梦……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46572880FD627E523076D475329E1F7684000A0031003753F791CE751F7279533A91CCFF0C00100001BE00000A90FD662F4E004E9B51F666B476845B9D53EF68A620262026FF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你这位训练家一看就很有实力，\n所以找羽毛这事就拜托你了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB64E00770B5C315F8867095B9E529BFF0C000A62404EE5627E7FBD6BDB8FD94E8B5C3162DC62584F604E86FF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜托你在17号野生特区这里\n帮我寻找盔甲鸟的羽毛吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC62584F6057280031003753F791CE751F7279533A8FD991CC000A5E2E62115BFB627E76D475329E1F76847FBD6BDB54273002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有盔甲鸟的羽毛掉在地上……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "670976D475329E1F76847FBD6BDB6389572857304E0A20262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是盔甲鸟的爪子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F76D475329E1F7684722A5B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是灯火幽灵的火焰烧出的灰烬。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F706F706B5E7D70757684706B713070E751FA7684707070EC30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是钥圈儿的钥匙碎片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F94A55708513F768494A55319788E724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是掘地兔的体毛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F63985730515476844F536BDB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是哈力栗的刺的一部分。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F54C8529B68177684523A76844E0090E8520630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是雌性火炎狮的鬃毛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F96CC6027706B708E72EE76849B036BDB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是雄性火炎狮的鬃毛。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F96C46027706B708E72EE76849B036BDB30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是闪闪发光的小石子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F95EA95EA53D1514976845C0F77F35B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是闪闪发光的珠子。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F95EA95EA53D15149768473E05B5030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真可惜……！\n这是闪闪发光的亮片。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F53EF60DC20262026FF01000A8FD9662F95EA95EA53D1514976844EAE724730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我察觉到你找到了盔甲鸟的羽毛，\n所以躲开火炎狮过来了！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n这会成为很厉害的菜刀啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BDF89C952304F60627E52304E8676D475329E1F76847FBD6BDBFF0C000A62404EE58EB25F00706B708E72EE8FC767654E86FF0100100001BE00000A8FD94F1A62104E3A5F8853895BB3768483DC5200554AFF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FF30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为什么！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4EC04E48FF01FF1F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "抱歉，\n拜托你将盔甲鸟赶走。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62B16B49FF0C000A62DC62584F605C0676D475329E1F8D768D703002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呼……盔甲鸟它为什么\n会袭击过来呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
