      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "547C2026202676D475329E1F5B834E3A4EC04E48000A4F1A88AD51FB8FC767655462FF1F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "莫非对你来说，\n脱落的羽毛也是很重要的？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但这对我来说也是很重要的羽毛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "83AB975E5BF94F6067658BF4FF0C000A8131843D76847FBD6BDB4E5F662F5F8891CD89817684FF1F00100001BE00000A4F468FD95BF9621167658BF44E5F662F5F8891CD898176847FBD6BDBFF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一位主厨，我希望能让他使用\n以盔甲鸟的羽毛制成的菜刀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E004F4D4E3B53A8FF0C62115E0C671B80FD8BA94ED64F7F7528000A4EE576D475329E1F76847FBD6BDB52366210768483DC52003002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他做出越多美味的料理，\n就越能让密阿雷的人和宝可梦幸福。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n拜托你了！请把羽毛让给我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED6505A51FA8D8A591A7F8E5473768465997406FF0C000A5C318D8A80FD8BA95BC6963F96F776844EBA548C5B9D53EF68A65E78798F300200100001BE00000A62DC62584F604E86FF018BF7628A7FBD6BDB8BA97ED9621154273002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意让给我吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F8BA97ED962115417FF1F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢你！\n我会把你的事情也告诉主厨的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C224F60FF01000A62114F1A628A4F6076844E8B60C54E5F544A8BC94E3B53A876843002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了！等主厨开始用\n新菜刀做菜之后，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你们一定要来鼎极哦！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86FF017B494E3B53A85F0059CB7528000A65B083DC5200505A83DC4E4B540EFF0C00100001BE00000A4F604EEC4E005B9A898167659F0E678154E6FF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "铿！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94FFFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道我的心意有没有\n成功传达给盔甲鸟。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E59053621176845FC3610F67096CA16709000A6210529F4F208FBE7ED976D475329E1F3002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE989876840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它会到店里来的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834F1A52305E9791CC676576840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和野生宝可梦友善相处\n到底是怎么一回事呢～？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C91CE751F5B9D53EF68A653CB558476F85904000A52305E95662F600E4E484E0056DE4E8B5462FF5EFF1F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏了你，我得到了\n比菜刀要宝贵得多的东西。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
